  "summary": "On maps of `u16::MAX` elements, `IndexMap::insert` could lead to a broken invariant",
  "details": "Note that this required filling up the map and having the last item inserted to hash to `u16::MAX`. It is therefore very unlikely to be reachable in a real-world scenario.\n\nReported by [8rsrf7](https://github.com/8rsrf7).",
